## 三、标准能力映射表

| 功能 | C# 服务 | HTTP | 控制器路由 | 前端 API | 权限末段* |
|------|---------|------|------------|----------|-----------|
| 分页列表 | `GetXxxListAsync` | GET | `list` | `getXxxList` | `list` |
| 详情 | `GetXxxByIdAsync` | GET | `{id}` | `getXxxById` | `query` |
| 下拉选项 | `GetXxxOptionsAsync(string? plantCode = null, string? keyword = null)` | GET | `options` | `getXxxOptions` | `query` |
| 新增 | `CreateXxxAsync` | POST | — | `createXxx` | `create` |
| 更新 | `UpdateXxxAsync` | PUT | `{id}` | `updateXxx` | `update` |
| 单删 | `DeleteXxxByIdAsync` | DELETE | `{id}` | `deleteXxxById` | `delete` |
| 批删 | `DeleteXxxBatchAsync` | DELETE | `batch` | `deleteXxxBatch` | `delete` |
| 状态 | `UpdateXxxStatusAsync` | PUT | `{id}/status` | `updateXxxStatus` | `update` |
| 导入模板 | `GetXxxTemplateAsync` | GET | `template` | `getXxxTemplate` | `import` |
| 导入 | `ImportXxxAsync` | POST | `import` | `importXxxData` | `import` |
| 导出 | `ExportXxxAsync` | GET | `export` | `exportXxxData` | `export` |

\* 完整权限码：`领域:目录[:子目录…]:实体:操作`（`00-project` §1.7）。菜单种子、`[TaktPermission]`、`v-permission`、工具栏 `*-permission` **四处一致**。

